    paragraph .connDataTagPointr                      anchor l+t   at x1          ymax+0.5      text 'Route Point Connectivity Data'
    line      .pointrLine                             anchor l+t   at x1          ymax-0.1      horizontal width 40
    paragraph .directionTag                           anchor l+t   at x1          ymax+0.1      text 'Direction from Previous:' width 16
    text      .direction                              anchor l+t   at xmax        ymin          call '!this.setPointrPositionGadget()' width 21 is DIRECTION
    paragraph .lengthTag                              anchor l+t   at x1          ymax+0.1      text 'Distance from Previous: ' width 16
    text      .lengthCwSeg                            anchor l+t   at xmax        ymin          call '!this.setPointrPositionGadget()' width 21 is REAL format !!distanceFmt

